# Codebase context (SnapletApp)
Android app: Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Hilt. Clean Architecture. Data flow: ApiService → RepositoryImpl (safeApiCall) → ViewModel (StateFlow) → Composable.
**Rule:** From the user prompt, infer which area(s) apply, then read only those paths (and their direct dependencies). Do not read the entire codebase.
